# Build-context filter for the root Dockerfile. Keeps .git, docs and non-Go
# tooling out of the `COPY . .` layer so unrelated changes do not bust the
# build cache.

.git
.github
.claude
docs
runner-images
scripts
*.md
*.local.md
dist/
bin/
coverage.*
*.test
*.out
.DS_Store

# --- Credential deny patterns ---------------------------------------------
#
# `COPY . .` copies the working tree, not what git tracks, so untracked local
# secrets (.env, keys, certificates, kubeconfig) would land in the builder
# layer and the BuildKit cache. The final distroless stage copies only the
# binary, so the published image is unaffected.
#
# Patterns are not recursive unless they say so: `*.pem` excludes `./key.pem`
# but not `./certs/key.pem`, hence the `**/` variants below. `credentials*`
# and `secrets*` stay root-only because they would match Go source such as
# internal/metadata/credentials.go. Do not add `**/` to them.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
**/*.pem
*.key
**/*.key
*.crt
**/*.crt
*.cer
**/*.cer
*.p12
**/*.p12
*.pfx
**/*.pfx
*.jks
**/*.jks
*.keystore
**/*.keystore
*.kdbx
*.gpg
*.asc
id_rsa*
**/id_rsa*
id_dsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*
**/id_ed25519*
*.ppk
known_hosts
.ssh/
.netrc
**/.netrc
.npmrc
**/.npmrc
.pypirc
**/.pypirc
.aws/
**/.aws/
.gcloud/
**/.gcloud/
.kube/
**/.kube/
.docker/
**/.docker/
secrets*
credentials*
service-account*.json
**/*service-account*.json
*.tfvars
*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
